OL,3,AChris Mason: Burnham faces crunch
OL,4,Adecisions and tricky trade-offs in his
OL,5,Anext 100 days
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis feels like the week where the
OL,8,Frubber hits the road for the prime
OL,9,Fminister's new government.
OL,11,FIt is now 100 days since Andy Burnham
OL,12,Farrived in Downing Street from
OL,13,FBuckingham Palace and began to assemble
OL,14,Fhis cabinet.
OL,16,FThree months later, Labour MPs are more
OL,17,Fchipper, the party's poll ratings have
OL,18,Fnotched up and the tone and style of
OL,19,Fgovernment feels very different from
OL,20,Fwhen Sir Keir Starmer was in charge.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
