OL,3,AChancellor to cut tariffs on marmalade
OL,4,Aand other products to help with
OL,5,Acost-of-living
OL,6,
OL,7,FImport taxes on marmalade, gherkins and
OL,8,Fmore than 100 products are being
OL,9,Fremoved ahead of the Budget by
OL,10,FChancellor John Healey in a move aimed
OL,11,Fat giving families "breathing space"
OL,12,Fwith the cost of living.
OL,14,FThe government is also bringing in
OL,15,Fmeasures to end the so-called
OL,16,Fcliff-edge for those receiving carer's
OL,17,Fallowance payments and will also make
OL,18,Fhigher tax-free mileage rates
OL,19,Fpermanent.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
