OL,3,ATruce begins in Ukraine city where
OL,4,Aresidents ate weeds to survive
OL,5,
OL,6,FA truce has begun in the
OL,7,FRussian-occupied Ukrainian city of
OL,8,FOleshky, a week after it was announced
OL,9,Fby US First Lady Melania Trump.
OL,11,FUkrainian officials and Russia's
OL,12,Fdefence ministry both say the limited
OL,13,Fceasefire is being respected. The
OL,14,Fceasefire is meant to allow aid
OL,15,Fdeliveries and the evacuation of
OL,16,Fcivilians, which has been planned for
OL,17,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
