OL,3,ATruce begins in Ukraine city where
OL,4,Aresidents ate weeds to survive
OL,5,
OL,6,FOleshky is trapped between the Dnipro
OL,7,FRiver, which forms the front line in
OL,8,Fthe Kherson region and separates it
OL,9,Ffrom Ukrainian positions, and Russian
OL,10,Fforces.
OL,12,FResidents still in the city are
OL,13,Fdesperately short of food, with many
OL,14,Fresorting to cooking garden weeds to
OL,15,Fsurvive. Some told the BBC this week
OL,16,Fthey are suffering extreme hunger and
OL,17,Fwant to leave.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
